WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.919
Self-Love precedes forgiveness.

00:00:13.199 --> 00:00:16.679
Full circle leads to square one.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.320
Returning Earthlings forget this.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.359
To rehearse for what we become.

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:30.960
The end is not our purpose.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.600
Each mountain a diving board.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.280
Abundance needs no surplus.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.880
True acceptance of is the cure.

00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:51.399
Stillness is part of transition.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.240
Darkness will spark the next vision.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.679
Truth needs no reason to rhyme.

00:01:03.679 --> 00:01:07.480
Presence regifts us our time.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.879
Silence will always speak volumes.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:18.879
Lost things have cost but no value.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.680
Progress is both death and birth.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:32.959
Life makes more sense in reverse.
